# Copy to .env.local for local development; set the same key in Vercel →
# Project → Settings → Environment Variables (Production) and redeploy.

# Web3Forms access key (https://web3forms.com). Create it with the inbox that
# should receive enquiries (sales-1@vntgroup.co.jp); the key is emailed there.
# It is public by design: it can only deliver to that inbox, not sign in.
# The site's key for sales-1@vntgroup.co.jp is built in; set this only to override it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
